?? "[DML-BEGIN]"
ON ERROR ? "ABBR-ERROR", ERROR()
SET HEAD OFF
SET SAFE OFF
USE BASE ALIA FIRST
DISP OFF NAME RECO 1
REPL NAME WITH "TEST" RECO 1 WHIL .T.
APPE BLAN
REPL NAME WITH "TAIL", BAL WITH 1500
GO TOP
LOCA FOR BAL>1000 WHIL .T.
? RECNO(), FOUND()
SELE 2
STOR 2 TO AREAFLAG
SELE FIRST
INDE ON NAME TO NAMES
STOR 5 TO STORED
STOR 6 TO STORENO
STOR "WITH WHILE RECORD DISPLAY" TO STORNAME
? STORED, STORENO, STORNAME, AREAFLAG
SAVE TO VALUES
STORED=99
REST FROM VALUES ADDI
? STORED
SET DELE OFF
SET DECI TO 2
CLOS INDE
USE BASE ALIA FIRST INDE NAMES
DISP OFF NAME RECO 1
STOREX 9 TO STORED
STORX 10 TO STORED
STO 11 TO STORED
DISPX
SELECTOR 3
SETX TALK OFF
USEX
DOX NOTHING
APPE BLANX
? STORED
USE
STOR 0 TO FLOWCNT
DO WHIL FLOWCNT<2
FLOWCNT=FLOWCNT+1
ENDD
IF FLOWCNT=2
FLOWCNT=FLOWCNT+1
ENDI
DO CASE
CASE .F.
FLOWCNT=99
OTHE
FLOWCNT=FLOWCNT+1
ENDC
DO BUMP WITH 3
? FLOWCNT, STORED
?? "[DML-END]"
PROC BUMP
PARA AMOUNT
STORED=STORED+AMOUNT
RETU
